sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator
    participant ServiceA
    participant ServiceB
    participant ServiceC

    Orchestrator->>ServiceA: Start task A
    par Parallel execution
        Orchestrator->>ServiceB: Start task B
    and
        Orchestrator->>ServiceC: Start task C
    end

    ServiceA-->>Orchestrator: Done A
    ServiceB-->>Orchestrator: Done B
